        "name": "Molten Shield",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Grants Annie or an ally a shield, a burst of Move Speed, and damages enemies who strike her with attacks or spells.",
        "bodyHtml": "Annie grants an ally champion <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(60/95/130/165/200 + (40% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 3 seconds and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(20% ~ 50%) Decaying Move Speed</span> for 1.5 seconds. While the shield holds, enemies who hit the shielded ally with an Attack or Ability receive <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/35/45/55/65 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> once per shield.<br /><br />Tibbers always gains the effects of <span>Molten Shield</span> when summoned.",
